  <h2>A World of Choice at Your Fingertips</h2>
  <p>Our <strong>digital product catalog</strong> is the primary tool for brands to explore our massive inventory of over 1,000+ activewear styles. Knowing how to navigate it efficiently will save you hours of sourcing time.</p>
  
  <h3>What's Inside the Catalog?</h3>
  <p>Each style in our catalog includes high-resolution photos, detailed fabric specifications, available colorways, and size ranges. We update the catalog weekly to include our latest R&D breakthroughs.</p>
  
  <h3>How to Source Effectively</h3>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Filter by Activity:</strong> Search specifically for Yoga, HIIT, Pilates, or Running gear.</li>
    <li><strong>Check Material Tech:</strong> Look for specific features like squat-proof knits, moisture-wicking, or recycled fibers.</li>
    <li><strong>Identify Ready-to-Ship:</strong> Clearly marked items are available for immediate private label customization.</li>
  </ul>

  <p>Ready to see our latest designs? Contact our team today to receive the most recent version of our Fitclo activewear catalog.</p>
